      },
      "title": "Segment Download Latency (p50 / p95)",
      "description": "End-to-end time per segment fetch — status line + yenc body transfer + any multi-pool fallback retries. Distinct from `nntp.command.ack_latency` (status line only) and `nntp.body.duration` (per-pool BODY round-trip): this metric is per-segment across all fallback attempts. Note: timed-out segments are *not* recorded here (timer is never stopped on cancellation) — track `nzb_segments_body_timeouts_total` for that tail.",
